# CODEOWNERS — automatic reviewers (Module 3)
# https://docs.github.com/articles/about-code-owners
#
# When a PR touches a matching path, the listed owners are requested for review
# automatically. Combine this with a branch protection rule ("Require review
# from Code Owners") to make it mandatory.
#
# Replace the placeholder handles below with real GitHub usernames or teams,
# e.g. @your-org/maintainers. Lines are last-match-wins.

# Default owner for everything in the repo
*                   @your-github-username

# The library source needs a maintainer's eyes
/src/               @your-github-username

# Workflow changes are sensitive — require the DevOps owner
/.github/workflows/ @your-github-username
